{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/894814-are-you-a-wikielf","id":894814,"title":"Are you a WikiElf?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-20T10:45:09-07:00","id":894814,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon1.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Are you a WikiElf?","content":"Good day, Children of the Night!<br /> <br /> I'm the guy who started WoDIndex (which is now <a href=\"http://wodcodex.com\" target=\"_blank\">WoDCodex</a>, and I have a favor to ask. I'm primarily a player of Mage, and although I own the 1st Edition books of both Vampire and Werewolf, I don't have or plan to get the 2nd Edition versions. As such, the pages related to them on the Codex are lacking content.<br /> <br /> If you have a passion for making your favorite game accessible to new players and more playable to veterans, could you stop by and give us a hand at getting the new information into the wiki, in a layout similar to what's there for 1st Edition?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://wodcodex.com/wiki/Category:Vampire:_the_Requiem\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: the Requiem @ WoDCodex</a><br /> <br /> Thank you!<br /> - Tom","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11818-romzombie","name":"ROMzombie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11818_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-20T13:02:20-07:00","id":894928,"title":"","content":"Hello. I was just looking over your 1st Edition and 2nd Edition core disciplines to get a feel for what you were looking for. I noticed in the first edition section at the bottom of the page there was a section labeled &quot;Blood and Smoke &quot; That IS 2nd Edition core. Blood and Smoke and 2nd Edition are the same thing. There are threads out here confirming that.<br /> <br /> Side note:<br /> <br /> What is the intent of these? The descriptions on some of the disciplines could be considered misleading. I dont know if that is the right word, perhaps... lacking?<br /> <br /> Example: Protean 3 &quot;Turn into predatory animal.&quot; you can turn in to scavengers and carrion beasts as well.. and 1 animal per dot of protean.<br /> <br /> Vigor &quot;Improved Str&quot; where as You actually get 1 dot of strength per dot of vigor and you can spend vitae for &quot;special effects&quot; such as Auto successes.<br /> <br /> Idol is not free. You always have to pay the cost.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2308,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","user":"Vitalis","date":". 05-20-2016, 04:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-20T13:11:51-07:00","id":894936,"title":"","content":"The intent of the wiki has always been to provide a quick reference, not a complete accounting of the rules (which may step over the line of fair use). Some of the entries can be expanded, but simplicity and clarity is generally more useful when you're trying to find something. Once you know what book it's in, and page it's on, you can determine the specifics without much effort.<br /> <br /> Also: I didn't add the B&amp;S information to the wiki, but if you have evidence that it should be moved to the 2nd Edition version of the pages, you'd be helping others if you made the changes. :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11818,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11818-romzombie","user":"ROMzombie","date":". 05-20-2016, 04:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11818-romzombie","name":"ROMzombie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11818_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-20T16:57:42-07:00","id":895142,"title":"","content":"What evidence would you be needing? They are the same book, after some confusion, it was simply retitled. <br /> <br /> I dont know how to make wikis. So I dont know how to correct the information.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T12:07:30-07:00","id":897046,"title":"","content":"Not &quot;evidence&quot; in the meaning of a court process, but evidence as in &quot;making a well-reasoned decision&quot;. I'm the opposite of a final arbiter here: I put this post up to get other people involved, since I'm not planning on buying the Werewolf or Vampire books.<br /> <br /> Editing a wiki page isn't hard. Just sign up for an account, click Edit, and type. Formatting is simple and standardized. You can either examine similar existing pages and copy the style, or see the docs described at <a href=\"https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/Help:Formatting\" target=\"_blank\">MediaWiki</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11818,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11818-romzombie","user":"ROMzombie","date":". 05-23-2016, 03:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11818-romzombie","name":"ROMzombie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11818_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}